OL,3,GNEWSA150 homes damaged by Storm Babet
OL,4,Aflooding to be demolished
OL,5,
OL,6,FA total of 150 homes in an Angus town
OL,7,Fwhich were devastated by Storm Babet
OL,8,Falmost three years ago are to be
OL,9,Fdemolished.
OL,11,FHundreds of people who fled their homes
OL,12,Fwhen the South Esk breached flood
OL,13,Fdefences in the River Street area of
OL,14,FBrechin were unable to return for
OL,15,Fmonths and many properties remain
OL,16,Fempty.
OL,18,FCouncillors have approved plans to
OL,19,Fdemolish 150 houses and flats, plus
OL,20,Ffive garages, as well as changes to the
OL,21,Friver's flood defences that could cost
OL,22,Fabout #8.2m.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
